proton-autogen (2.7.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * New UX features (major update)
    - Added badges types (DX11, DX12, Win95, Install, ...)
    - Added dynamic game badges system (favorite, recent, playtime ranks, humor badges)
    - Added bilingual badge system (FR / EN support)
    - Improved GameList UI with inline badges next to game titles
    - Added real-time badge updates on game edit (LIVE UI refresh)
    - Enhanced GTK4 layout with structured header (title + badges row)

  * Statistics system overhaul
    - Added playtime aggregation (seconds → hours + minutes display)
    - Improved global dashboard stats (games count, favorites, total playtime)
    - Fixed stats not updating on runtime session
    - Added session tracking foundation for future analytics

  * Runtime and launch system improvements
    - Fixed launch crash: invalid returncode scope handling
    - Added session finalization logic (end_time / start_time tracking)
    - Improved run() execution flow stability
    - Better Proton execution environment handling
    - Improved error handling during game launch

  * Backend improvements
    - Added finalize_session() for playtime tracking integration
    - Added update_playtime() integration hook
    - Improved save_game_config() merge logic (deep merge safe)
    - Fixed inconsistent config schema handling
    - Improved prefix system handling (reuse / selection / creation)

  * Proton & environment management
    - Improved Proton detection (system + user + Steam paths)
    - Added Proton selection UI with auto-best-match option
    - Enhanced Proton scoring system (GE / Experimental / Cachy priority)
    - Fixed duplicate Proton detection issues

  * Game system improvements
    - Improved game scanning UX system
      * Limited scan scope to user directories:
        ~/Bureau, ~/Downloads, ~/Jeux, ~/Téléchargements
      * Added deep scan limitation to prevent slow legacy scans
      * Added exclusion rules for system/Windows/cache folders
    - Improved Windows .exe discovery logic (UX + performance)
    - Added game registry system (~/.config/proton-autogen/games)

  * UI/UX improvements (GTK4)
    - Improved GameList rendering performance
    - Added structured subtitle system (profile / proton / prefix / features)
    - Added clickable launch/edit buttons per game row
    - Improved dashboard layout (overlay + background system)
    - Added search filtering with live stats update
    - Improved header bar actions (refresh, menu integration)

  * Localization
    - Added FR/EN badge definitions system
    - Improved language detection integration in UX layer

  * Stability fixes
    - Fixed "returncode referenced before assignment" crash in launcher
    - Fixed badge rendering missing in some UI states
    - Fixed row update inconsistency in GameList.update_game()
    - Improved safe handling of missing config fields

  * Developer experience
    - Improved separation between backend / UX / stats / config layers
    - Added diagnostic tools (runtime + system + Proton detection)
    - Improved debug output for launch system
    - Cleaner internal API for game registration and updates

